390	 * is in PSRAM, and running the ESP-NN/TFLM Invoke on a PSRAM stack wedges the
391	 * SoC (console goes dead, "semaphore timeout") -- the same trap the flash model
392	 * loader hit. A pthread's stack is heap/internal RAM, where it runs fine.
393	 * Protocol: 0 idle -> 1 request -> 2 busy -> 3 done -> 0. */
