377	 * The board wedged (console "semaphore timeout") after a long idle on the
378	 * Enroll tab -- the preview grabs a frame every FRAME_INTERVAL_MS forever, so
379	 * minutes of idling = many thousands of captures, and the next Capture died.
380	 * Every capture goes through here so the log tells us the frame number at the
381	 * wedge: a repeatable count => something leaks per-capture; no pattern => it's
382	 * time/temperature/electrical. Do not guess this one again.
