404	 * Their arenas are separate, so this is not about the arenas -- it is the
405	 * ESP-NN kernels underneath them, which VelaPaw builds with the optimised
406	 * path and which are not documented to be reentrant.  Serialising costs
407	 * nothing we can measure (vision runs at most every RECOG_INTERVAL_MS, voice
408	 * classify is ~90 ms) whereas the failure mode for getting it wrong on this
409	 * board is a dead console with no backtrace.  Capture is deliberately OUTSIDE
410	 * the lock: the 2 s mic read must overlap with vision, not block it. */
411	static pthread_mutex_t        g_tflm_lock = PTHREAD_MUTEX_INITIALIZER;
