380- * Enroll tab -- the preview grabs a frame every FRAME_INTERVAL_MS forever, so
381- * minutes of idling = many thousands of captures, and the next Capture died.
382- * Every capture goes through here and is counted.  The count used to be a
383- * console line every 200 grabs; it is now in the 10-minute health line (see
