701	 * this existed nothing rewrote it when one changed: a time set by the agent,
702	 * the Edit dialog or the voice dialog stayed invisible to the agent until the
703	 * next feed or reboot.  On 2026-10-13 the agent moved Bob's breakfast to
704	 * 07:45, then one turn later read status.md and told the owner it was 05:00.
705	 * The history arrays are untouched, so this writes only the digest.
706	 */
707	void velapaw_store_status_refresh(void)
708	{
709	  vp_status_write();
710	}
